"明"}},{"title":"天目山 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"赭铁青铜凌紫烟，能为人语向人间。\n二千年事说不尽，夜夜青溪劳往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39411,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天目山 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"断壁孤杉四十围，不关雨雪阴霏霏。\n柯南一国痴蝼蚁，长怪曾无白日飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39412,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南海曲","author":"徐渭","text":"一尺高鬟十五人，爱侬云鬓怯侬胜。\n近来海舶久不到，欲寄玳瑁簪未曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39413,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉则拟红衫四貌 其一 春郊走马","author":"徐渭","text":"春郊大堤无尽头，沈郎走马著红裘。\n回鞭故遣穿杨柳，冲落杨花扑紫骝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39414,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉则拟红衫四貌 其二 东山拥伎","author":"徐渭","text":"道人道帔剪轻霞，醉卧青楼小伎家。\n小伎红衫何处买，同是南京杏子纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39415,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉则拟红衫四貌 其三 秋江把钓","author":"徐渭","text":"戴进不得武英收，为抹勾漏绛钓裘。\n若使今朝逢沈四，真成伯乐哭骅骝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39416,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉则拟红衫四貌 其四 高楼对雪","author":"徐渭","text":"高楼一衲锦毛梭，万玉屏围红叵罗。\n雪里茶花侬似否，急催滕六剪银河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39417,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京歌 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"西北池中有斗牛，人传一挂一时收。\n要知不是凡鳞介，只看眉潭白两毬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39418,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京歌 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"绣人须样绣新裘，争看池中活斗牛。\n及至见时无脚走，各嫦红袖急遮头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39419,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京歌 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"斗牛何处见英豪，狞眼令人胆不牢。\n及问当年亲见者，只推雾里见分毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39420,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京歌 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"萧后梳妆别起楼，太湖石在水空流。\n而今楼瓦飘零尽，只乞中官看石头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39421,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京歌 其五","author":"徐渭","text":"绿树连云拨不开，忽扶黄瓦出楼台。\n堤长水阔三千丈，一日惟看一殿回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39422,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京歌 其六","author":"徐渭","text":"千里马来自西南，夷馆朝廷锁钥严。\n几回欲看无由看，墙外听嘶出屋檐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39423,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京歌 其七","author":"徐渭","text":"贡来狮子看曾真，养在西城十四春。\n更欲乞看云不可，昨朝攫碎菜园人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39424,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京五月歌 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"石榴花发街欲焚，蟠枝屈朵皆崩云。\n千门万户买不尽，剩与女儿染红裙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39425,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京五月歌 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"竹黄如槁少鲜妍，一丛五卑百个钱。\n卖与人家那不贵，汤浇火炙过冬天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39426,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京五月歌 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"荸荠菱藕贱如柴，竿蔗年来渐亦栽。\n百货百珍俱得到，却无一个荔枝来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39427,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京五月歌 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"燕京百事且休忧，但苦炎天道上沟。\n近日巳闻将扫括，不须遮鼻过风头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39428,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自马水还道中竹枝词","author":"徐渭","text":"湾湾曲曲几山溪。\n眼眼腮腮泪落丝。\n立到马遥人影没，更谁知尔下山时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39429,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乘霁自福田遍历善应翠微洪光大悲诸招提翠有石洞西夏僧兀坐其中自言至此可六万里斋罢拟游西湖辄止","author":"徐渭","text":"禅槽养马似支公，控马长须鬓插红。\n却说看山须霁好，昨宵湿马费梳騣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39430,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上谷歌 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"居庸卵石一何多，大者如象小如鹅。\n千堆万叠无他事，东掷西抛只蹶骡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39431,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上谷歌 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"八达高坡百尺强，径连大漠去荒荒。\n舆幢尽日山油碧，戍堡终年雾噀黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39432,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上谷歌 其五","author":"徐渭","text":"塞外河流入塞驰，一般曲曲作山溪。\n不知何事无鱼鳖，一石惟容五斗泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39433,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上谷歌 其六","author":"徐渭","text":"昨向居庸剑戟过，今朝流水是洋河。\n无数黄旗呵过客，有时青草站鸣驼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39434,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上谷歌 其七","author":"徐渭","text":"橐驼本是胡家物，拽入人看似拽牛。\n见说辽东去年捷，夺得千头与百头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39435,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早渡银洞岭","author":"徐渭","text":"银洞高高岭百盘，峰峦插笋倚天班。\n冯谁唤起王摩诘，画作贤人晓过关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39436,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边词 其七","author":"徐渭","text":"八里庄儿一堡中，银镮小杏坠腮红。\n妆成自不撩人看，起莝黄刍喂铁骢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39437,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边词 其十一","author":"徐渭","text":"汗血生驹撒手驰，况能妆态学南闺。\n帓将皂帕穿风去，爱缀银花绰雪飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39438,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边词 其十三","author":"徐渭","text":"曾见思归数寄书，忠魂毕竟滞边隅。\n可怜一斗苌弘血，博得墙围柳数株。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39439,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]